      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <link>https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/releases/tag/v1.3.0</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li>Import a paint stash exported from Scalemates</li>
<li>Update existing paints when re-importing a CSV</li>
<li>Export and import projects</li>
</ul>
<h3>Issues fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/issues/12">#12</a> Export and import projects</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/issues/24">#24</a> Update existing paints when re-importing a CSV</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/issues/48">#48</a> Import a paint stash exported from Scalemates</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/compare/v1.2.1...v1.3.0">https://github.com/jvanlint/BenchBook/compare/v1.2.1...v1.3.0</a></p>
